  <p id="c-jinshu-040-jin044-huayi:first" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">中書監<persName id="c-jinshu-040-jin044-huayi:first:m0003" ref="418_c91_b6b">華廙</persName>恐懼，自往索之，終不肯與。</p>
  <p id="c-jinshu-040-jin044-huayi:second" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">便召中書監<persName id="c-jinshu-040-jin044-huayi:second:m0005" ref="e5e_8ac_f12">華暠</persName>、令<persName id="c-jinshu-040-jin044-huayi:second:m0009" ref="ij0_gmq_io0">何劭</persName>，口宣帝旨使作遺詔</p>
